  "interpretation": {
    "en": "Observed outside miss rates A/B/C: 11.4% / 1.4% / 1.4%; in-scope review: 0.0% / 3.0% / 3.0%. Read both together: fewer misses can require more human review. An explicit none option does not guarantee that unknown requests are caught. Validation selected p ≥ 0 and gap ≥ 0 for C, so C equals B: this set shows no additional benefit from the probability gates. A’s observed test accepted error is 7.4%; the 5% validation target is not a held-out guarantee.",
    "zh": "实测 A／B／C 候选外漏检率分别为 11.4%／1.4%／1.4%；正常请求转人工比例为 0.0%／3.0%／3.0%。两者需要一起看：降低漏检可能增加人工量，提供 none 不保证识别所有未知请求。 验证集为 C 选出的门槛是 p ≥ 0、gap ≥ 0，因此 C 与 B 相同；这组数据没有显示叠加概率门槛的额外收益。 A 的测试集自动处理错误率为 7.4%，验证集的 5% 目标并不是独立测试保证。"
  },
